  "prefLabel": "Sphc 500 ETHICAL STANDARDS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Sphc 500 ETHICAL STANDARDS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nThe Governing Board of Speech-Language Pathologists (Spe) and the Board of Hearing Care Providers (Hcp) were merged into the Governing Board of Speech-Language Pathologists and Hearing Care Providers pursuant to 20211, 91:168, 172, and 178, effective 7-1-21. All of the existing rules under Spe and Hcp were transferred to the prefix Sphc.\n\nAll filings prior to Document #14311, effective 7-10-25 can be found in the filing history for the Spe 500 and Hcp 500 rules.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sphc500.html"
